Code statements:
```c
-		set_current_state(TASK_PARKED);
+		set_special_state(TASK_PARKED);
-	complete_all(&self->parked);
-void kthread_park_complete(struct task_struct *k)
-{
-	complete_all(&to_kthread(k)->parked);
-}
